1924	2026-06-05 01:56:20.017679+00	33169	M3		21	Food is one of the most important thing in all cultures. Although, all culture have food, each culture delelops its own styles of their food. In particular, street food in Thailand. Three of the most popular street foods in Thailand are moo-ping, pad thai, and pad ka praow.<br><br><br>The most well known street food is moo-ping, the ingredients are chopped pork, a wooden stick, and some soy sauce, which is made by stab the wooden stick into the pork and grill it on the barbecue stove then apply the sauce that you like or soy sauce on the pork as you grilling it. And when its cooked, you can eat it with rice or sticky rice. Moo-ping is the food that represent Thai people life style in the past where they want a food that have simple ingredients, not expensive and can fill their stomach. This make moo-ping one of the most beloved Thai street food and commonly enjoyed with sticky rice as a snack or breakfast.<br><br><br>Beside enjoying moo-ping, pad thai is also another great choice of street food. Pad thai is known for its perfect balance of sweet, sour, salty and umami flavors. It is a stir fried noodle dish which includes rice noodles, tofu or shrimp, egg, bean sprouts and the based sauce. Pad thai is often prepare right in front of customer, using high heat and rapidly cooking techniques to create the signature smoky aroma and colorful looks, made it a must try Thai dish. And this represent how Thai people used local ingrediants to create an unique and one of the most poplur dish in the wrold.<br><br><br>Finally, pad ka proaw, stir fried basil with meal, is a staple meal for many Thais who want a quick and delicious meal. The ingredients are as simple as its name, pork or chicken, garlic, basil leaves and soy sauce. Firstly, you chop the garlic and stir them on the hot pan with some oil, then add the meat and soy sauce, finally, add basil leaves and stir fried them well. Its commonly serve with rice and fried egg, its only take small amout of time to make. Pad ka proaw can be seen in every resturant not only in street food. Because of its comforting taste makes everyone loved it. This shows that Thai people like food that have simple ingredients, delicious yet affordable.<br><br><br>To sum up, Thai street food are mostly made by local ingredients that the locals can find such as moo-ping, pad th and pad ka praow which also made by the local ingredients because thai people don't really like to wake their food, yet its still flavorful and popular till today.	12	5	0	0	3	4	6	7	0	4	0	0	3	5	2	0	0	0	8	9	2	0	0	0	0	4	2	1	1	0	3	2	0	0	0	2	1	0	2	0	0	0	1	0	448	2026	2025-08-14
