 mentioned. I hope now you have a clearer information about these food.	14	3	1	0	1	1	3	4	0	0	0	2	3	5	2	0	0	0	2	15	1	0	0	2	0	3	1	0	3	1	2	0	0	0	1	0	5	1	2	0	0	0	2	0	345	2026	2025-08-14
