2391	2026-06-05 01:56:20.561028+00	34288	M3		32	There are alot kind of food in the world. Although all cultures have different food. In particular, Thai culture for each part there are add different kind of food too The most famous food in Thailand is Somtum, Tom Tum and Kuay-Tiew<br><br><br>A first amazing food in Thailand is Som-Tum, which is from Northeast of Thailand or we know as E-san. Som-Tum is a spicy papaya salad mix witha Thai local vegetables and herbs. The main ingredients is plara, which is show how Thai people keep food longer by using salt. We have to pound papaya with chilly, lime, plara, tomato and other ingredients until green papaya turn in to yellow color. No need fire to make som-tum it very easy to make. but we have to make sure that every ingredients is fresh.<br><br><br>A second amazing food in Thailand is Tom-Yum which is from central of Thailand. Tom-Yum is have alot of kind example Tom-Yum Kung (shrimp), Tom-Yum - pla (fish), Tom-Yum Talay (seafood). I will talk about Tom-Yum Kung which is the most famous. The main ingredients is chilly paste, hot chili to make the soup red and Thai local herbs to make it smell - good and shrimp is on top. eat with white rice That amazing.<br><br><br>A third amazing food in Thailand is Kuay-Tiew which is from Ayutthaya city. It a Thai noodle with Delicious soup. pork and pork ball, soup is the most important because soup is make everything in bowl delicious. Ingredients to make soup is pork spine seasoning sauce, portant leaves, Dork soy sauce, The soup is brown because of cow blood in the soup. In Ayutthaya era people sell Kuay-Tiew on the small boat because in the past most people travel by boat That why people call Kuay-Tiew rhea.<br><br><br>In short, Thai food is different for each part of Thailand. each part have their own signature in gredients to make their food different. That why you go to different part you can try different food too.	20	5	0	0	1	5	4	2	0	2	0	0	1	0	2	0	1	0	4	12	2	0	0	1	0	5	2	0	3	3