on on Bogota's origins and growth was excellent! You used a wide range of vocabulary and complex grammatical structures accurately, and your explanation was very clear and well-organized. You presented a lot of interesting historical details. To improve further, remember to slow down slightly and emphasize key points to make your presentation even more engaging. Fantastic work!	B1+	Speaking	Formative	PET	\N	\N
