ume meant that much of your presentation was missed.	1	You interacted well with the slides but got anchored on them and did not engage with the audience. This may have been due to nervousness.	8.0	Hello Ie Ie, you presented a structured overview of Kanchanaburi's history and special places. To improve, focus on increasing your volume and projecting your voice to engage your audience better. Work on refining your grammatical accuracy and expanding your vocabulary to provide more detailed descriptions. Also, try to reduce reliance on the slides and interact more directly with the audience. With practice, you can overcome your nervousness and deliver a more impactful presentation.	B1	Speaking	CA	FIRST	\N	\N
