ue curls back slightly without touching. Keep practicing these sounds! 🗣️</p>	\N	NULL	8.0	<p>Hello Nine! 👋 You did a good job introducing your hero, Toon Bodyslam, and outlining your presentation. It’s clear you have enthusiasm for your topic! To really shine in your next assessment, focus on expanding your ideas with more detail and connecting your points smoothly. Keep practicing, and you'll definitely see improvement! Keep up the great effort! ✨</p>	B1	Speaking	CA	FIRST	\N	\N
