ul book review that met all the requirements of the task! You used a clever rhetorical question to start your talk and provided a clear summary of the plot, including the climax and resolution. Your vocabulary was well-chosen for a fantasy topic, and your use of cohesive devices made the story easy to follow. To improve, try to pay closer attention to small grammar details like subject-verb agreement and the use of the verb 'to be.' You can also make your opinions stronger by adding specific examples from the book. Keep sharing your love for reading! 🌟	B1+	Speaking	CA	PET	\N	\N
