se room a lot.\n\nI like to play game with my friends too and sometimes I love to play chess with my friends. If my day was total stressful, I would sometimes take a shower, a lot of shower, it's really help me cool off a lot and help me forgot about things and relax.	410	4	Kun, you demonstrate good control of grammar and a strong vocabulary range. Try to incorporate even more varied sentence structures to further engage your listener.	4	You did a great job of providing detailed answers and linking your ideas together, Kun. To improve further, try to minimize small hesitations by planning your sentences in advance.	4	Kun, Sound production clear, but overstresses final syllables. Focusing on these small details will make your already good communication even more precise. Keep up the great work!	4	You interact very well with your partner, Kun, and respond thoughtfully to questions. Try to ask even more follow-up questions to keep the conversation moving forward.	16.0	Kun, you did a great job! You are a clear and effective communicator. With a bit more focus on grammar precision and pronunciation, you'll be performing at the highest level. All the best, Ed	B1+	Speaking	Term 2 Finals	PET	\N	\N
