al review of the Three Little Pigs. You used excellent vocabulary like "empathy" and "friendship" and organized your talk with good transition words like "in the beginning." To improve, make sure to include all task requirements like the author's name and a hook. Try to practice your past tense verbs and comparatives like "worse" instead of "more bad." Reducing hesitations will also help your speech flow more smoothly. Well done on a successful presentation! 🌟	A2+	Speaking	CA	PET	\N	\N
