learly expressed your preference for the healthy food fair and negotiated towards an outcome by explaining your reasoning while still showing you understood Florence's point about the vegetable garden. This collaborative and engaging approach made your interactions highly effective. Keep being such a thoughtful and clear communicator! 🤩	17.0	Hi Grace! Your speaking performance was truly excellent, showing wonderful fluency and a clear ability to express your ideas. You did a fantastic job of interacting with your partner and the examiner. To reach even higher levels, focusing on refining some grammatical structures and ensuring all consonant sounds are clearly pronounced will be a big help. Keep up the great work! 🎉<br><br>📋 **Action Plan for Grace:**<br>*   ✔️ Pay close attention to verb forms, especially after "I'm" or "I was," to make sure they're always correct.<br>*   ✔️ Practice pronouncing words ending with /t/ and /d/ sounds, like 'didn't' or 'dirt,' making sure they're not dropped.<br>*   ✔️ When you're speaking, try to notice if you use words like "like" as a filler, and see if you can replace it with a pause or a more precise phrase.	B2+	Speaking	Term 1 Finals	FIRST	\N	\N
