e in fun than doing alone.\n\nThey could like help you fix your posture when you exercise.\n\nI think it is important to prepare a healthy food because students use like energy to learn and do activity in class.\n\nSo healthy food will help them become refreshing.\n\nUm, after a busy day at school, I often like just sit, I'll go take a bath quickly and have some sleep quickly with my siblings or maybe playing video games with my siblings helps you.\n\nYeah, same with Vegas because like kids, uh, students or kids these day like they like to play video games more than hang out with their friends in real life.\n\nThey like to hang out with their friends like on online, so they wouldn't be doing anything much.\n\nYes, I like to try new sport in the future because I think like the more you can play sport, the more you can have a make friends with the other kind of people who play, who play that different sport, yeah.	533	3	Milan, you have a good range of vocabulary for everyday topics! For example, you used the phrase 'fix your posture' when talking about exercising with friends. To make your sentences even stronger, remember to double-check your verb tenses. Instead of saying 'the more you can have a make friends', it would be better to say 'the more you can make friends'.	4	You did a nice job extending your answers, Milan, and expressing your ideas clearly. You used phrases like 'in my opinion' to introduce your thoughts. To improve, focus on reducing filler words like 'like' and 'um'. For example, instead of 'They run outside like in forest', try 'They run outside in a forest'.	3	Milan, your intonation is very natural, which makes you easy to understand. I noticed you sometimes swallow consonant sounds at the end of words, which can make it a bit harder to understand you clearly. Try to pronounce plosive consonants like /p/, /t/, and /k/ more effectively. For instance, make sure people can clearly hear the /t/ at the end of words like 'sport'.	4	Milan, you were a grea