r points and provide more engaging details to keep the reader interested.	You connected your ideas using basic linking words like "because" and "For example". The text has a basic structure with an introduction to your feeling and then an example. However, the organisation could be improved by using a wider variety of cohesive devices and perhaps separating the ideas into clearer paragraphs. The current structure is quite simple.	You used everyday vocabulary to discuss your experience, such as "struggling to fit in," "weird," and "social platforms." There are some noticeable errors with plurals ("many experience" instead of "many experiences") and verb agreement ("the reason are" instead of "the reason is"). You used simple grammatical forms with some degree of control, but errors do occasionally impede the clarity of your meaning. To improve, focus on subject-verb agreement and correct use of plural nouns.	2.0	1.5	1.5	2.0	Writing	Formative	FIRST	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	A2+	\N	\N	\N	A2+	2026
