monstrated good intonation, the issues with individual sounds and word stress significantly impacted overall clarity. To achieve a score of 5, you need to intensely focus on articulating all word endings clearly and consciously work on modifying your word stress patterns to align with English pronunciation. Practice exercises specifically designed to improve final consonant sounds and native-like stress to enhance overall intelligibility.	Hello Sun, your presentation on Osaka was informative, and you attempted to engage the audience, especially at the beginning. You showed good intonation. To significantly improve, focus on consistently pronouncing word endings, reducing your Thai word stress patterns, and consistently engaging with your audience throughout your presentation rather than primarily speaking to the slides.	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	B1	\N	\N	\N	B1	2026
