 "enlightened," "clossed" should be "closed," "buddha" should be "Buddha") and capitalization (e.g., "Makha Bucha day" should be "Makha Bucha Day").	1.0	2.0	2.0	3.0	Writing	Formative	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	A2	\N	\N	\N	A2	2026
