lation about your friend is excellent.<br><br>To improve:<br><li><b>Visuals!</b> 👁️ You mentioned 'hell' and 'skeletons'. detailed description of what the 'boss' friend looked like in this form would make the reveal even more shocking.</li>	Your story was incredibly suspenseful! 😱 I really felt the character's fear.<br><br>To improve:<br><li><b>Pacing!</b> ⏱️ The ending 'he sent me up... and I've never seen him again' is very effective, but maybe add one sentence about how the character felt *after* returning. Relief? Sadness?</li>	Your use of linking words like 'Subsequently', 'Suddenly', and 'Ultimately' is very sophisticated. 🎓 It makes the story flow like a professional piece.<br><br>To improve:<br><li><b>Variety!</b> 🔄 You use 'Suddenly' twice. Try mixing it up with 'All of a sudden' or 'Without warning' to keep it fresh.</li>	Your vocabulary is impressive! Words like 'automatically', 'mystery', and 'confident' are great. 🌟<br><br>Here are a few small polishes:<br><li><b>Irregular Verbs!</b> 🛠️ 'Shutted' -> '<b>Shut</b>', 'Lighted' -> '<b>Lit</b>'.</li><li><b>Phrasing!</b> 🔄 'War and monsters voices' -> 'The <b>sounds</b> of war and monsters'.</li><li><b>Prepositions!</b> 📍 'Sent me up on to the Earth' -> 'Sent me back <b>to</b> Earth'.</li>	5.0	5.0	5.0	5.0	Writing	Term 2 Midterm	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	B2	\N	\N	\N	B2	2026
