1045	28836	2025-08-15 08:42:58.64346+00	Thai Food	You cant survive without food. Although all cultures have their own unique food. In Thailand, there are regional food the most famous is Issan, which is Thailand north east. Three of the most famous Issan foods are Prala, Somtum, and Soy ju.<br><br><br>One of the most popular Issan food is Prala which is known by its strong smell. It's made from fish and salt. The way to make Prala is. First step, you need a big bowl and put fish in the bowl. Secondly, you put salt in the bowl. And now, you need to let it merinate. It's a really fascinating Issan food that represent Thailand. Because Prala, develope when Thai people don't have refrigerator. It's a very interest way to keep food eatable and preserve.<br><br><br>Besides of Prala, the second popular Issan food is Somtam, which mostly known or called papaya salad. The basic ingredients of Somtam are papaya, tomato, lime, chillies, Prala, and seasoning such as salt, sugar, and msg. With all the ingredients, you can make a Somtum. How to make it is very easy but you need some tools. The tools are mortar and pestle, which will play a very important role in this dish. First step, you need to put all the ingredients in mortar and add seasoning. Lastly, you need to smash it with the pestle. This is one of the most well-know dish in Thailand. Because Somtum really represent Thailand in many ways. First is the flavour, Somtum uses chillies, which made this dish flavourish and memorable.<br><br><br>Finally, the dish that represents Thailand regional food from Issan is Soy ju, a very simple meal to make. This dish include any raw meat and Kao Kuea, a grinded rice as ingredients. The ways to cook is very easy just mix Kao Kua with raw meat. Then dipped it in any sauce you desire. It really represent Thailand by the way they use sauce to bring flavour to the dish<br><br><br>To summarize, Thailand regional food are very unique an interesting. Example like Prala, Somtam, and Soy ju Pr