e', 'so'). To improve, ensure consistent paragraphing for each new major development in the plot.	Vocabulary is generally appropriate ('obsessed', 'desires', 'reality'). There are some grammatical errors ('decided to made', 'no one have ever discovery', 'spend') but they do not impede meaning. To improve, focus on correcting basic verb forms (e.g., base form after 'to') and consistent past tense usage.	5.0	4.0	4.0	3.0	Writing	CA	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	B1+	\N	\N	\N	B1+	2026
