elicate smell coming out of it, then warp then warp everything up and finishing it up by mixing it up with coconut milk.<br><br><br>It represent Thailand by every house that able to make it, has to be royalty or a welthy house only because of the ingredient and you need a lot of participation to make it to be all perfection, Eventhough it was easy but to make it perfect you need to do a lot of practicing.<br><br><br>In conclusion, the most famous dessert that represent Thailand that most are, Bualoi, Coconut Icecream and Khanom sai sai, These three was a well known Thai desserts around the world, Overall all of these dessert can make Thailand more valuable by and having the most delicate flavour of all time. having the best perspective	467	\N	Overall, your essay effectively introduces three popular Thai desserts and explains their cultural significance. You demonstrate a good range of vocabulary, including words like "spectacular," "inquisitive," and "delicate." Your use of linking words such as "Besides" and "Lastly" helps to connect your ideas, and you have successfully used the required linking phrase "Besides Bua Loi" to start your second body paragraph. To improve your writing further, focus on consistently using correct grammar, particularly subject-verb agreement and noun-pronoun agreement, and pay close attention to capitalization and punctuation.	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	Writing	Formative	FIRST	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	2026
