oo. ... If I can choose one from here to visit next time, I would choose the Elephant World because I have a wish that to play with elephants once in my life. Ie Ie: ... In the, in the summary, we have told you about the three things about Kanchanaburi which is history, special places, nature, and outdoor activities that you can go there. I hope that you have a clearer picture of this city and if you if your families want to find a place to visit next time or travel to, why don't you suggest them to go to Kanchanaburi so you can have a better picture than how we talk about. Thank you.	\N	8.0	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	Speaking	CA	FIRST	You spoke very quietly, making it difficult to hear without a microphone. While your intonation was generally good, the lack of volume meant that much of your presentation was missed.	Hello Ie Ie, you presented a structured overview of Kanchanaburi's history and special places. To improve, focus on increasing your volume and projecting your voice to engage your audience better. Work on refining your grammatical accuracy and expanding your vocabulary to provide more detailed descriptions. Also, try to reduce reliance on the slides and interact more directly with the audience. With practice, you can overcome your nervousness and deliver a more impactful presentation.	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	B1	\N	\N	\N	B1	2026
