sy to follow your thoughts. To reach a 4 or 5, consider using more varied sentence structures and transition words to create a smoother flow between your ideas. For example, instead of starting multiple sentences with "I," you could use phrases like "What I also found interesting was..." or "Another compelling aspect was..."	You use a good range of vocabulary for a B1 level, but there are some grammatical and spelling errors that affect clarity. For example, "artical" should be "article," "it's show" should be "it shows," and "they are began" should be "they began." To improve, focus on proofreading carefully and using a grammar checker. Also, be mindful of correct word choice; for instance, "Maybe we should aware" should be "Maybe we should be aware."	4.0	4.0	3.0	3.0	Writing	Formative	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	B1	\N	\N	\N	B1	2026
