3235	29135	2026-01-12 15:44:00.483826+00	Book Review	Hello everyone, my name's Arthur. Today I'm going to talk about story called Rabbit and the Turtle. [laugh] Have you ever wondered why ... when you work several hours just to be caught by smart people? When you work sweating and you tired ... just to became useless.<br>Now, I'm going to talk about some stories that could, some, give you some willpowers, you know. Just from the start ... the story is just childish, story from the kindergarten. Nothing really, but it teach us something really important, you know.<br>The story take parts in a ... random ... glassy world ... there were, there was nothing really, just a tree then some fancy cartoon stuff. [laugh] The main story start when a rabbit ... he thought what he was fastest here. The turtle heard it and he thought this rabbit was too ... telling everyone fake news. But everyone proof him that he is right, but turtle, he think he was wrong. So the turtle was determined. The turtle was tell him to ... have a race.<br>When the day comes ... the turtle and the rabbits start the race. The turtle leaps up and the rabbit leaps up, but he was faster. The turtle just only could walking. [laugh] He was slow, but he was determined. And then when the race start ... rabbit leaps up quickly, but ... he ran, he ran for several miles ... kilometers. When he decide he want to take a nap, for ... then when he nap, he was fell asleep.<br>The turtle was suddenly catch him off because the rabbit just sleep. [laugh] The turtle was determined and he was almost win the race, when the rabbit wake up and find out that he gonna lose the race. He quickly ran to the finish line ... then the turtle just walk passed the line and chill. When he find out that he was lose, he was cry. The turtle tell him that he was to ... not determined, he don't have any willpowers, you know. [laugh] So, to sum up ... powers, talent alone isn't enough, yeah. You need to have a willpower, you have to need to .