y suits the topic of a personal essay. Nonetheless, the unfinished ending and lack of full development sometimes reduce the impact. To improve, please finish your writing fully and try to expand your ideas to keep the reader interested.	Your essay has some organisation with separate paragraphs, but it does not completely follow the requested five-paragraph format. The writing feels incomplete because of the missing conclusion and some very brief paragraphs. There is only basic use of linking words, and the flow between ideas could be smoother. To improve, plan your essay carefully to include all required paragraphs and use linkers to connect your thoughts.	You use vocabulary relevant to the topic, such as "pomelo," "market," and "temple," but many spelling mistakes and errors in grammar reduce clarity (e.g., "brid" instead of "bird," "natare" instead of "nature," "travle" instead of "travel"). There are also errors with articles and verb forms. Capitalisation and punctuation are inconsistent, which affects the quality of your writing. Paying closer attention to spelling, and punctuation rules will help you communicate your ideas more clearly.	3.0	3.0	2.0	2.0	Writing	CA	FIRST	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cFmq4K2oHYkE4yIkPRNskT3opJFRSJ--?usp=sharing	B1+	\N	\N	\N	B1+	2026
