liens'. What did they look like? Were they big, small, green, scary?</li><li><b>The Light Ball!</b> ✨ The transformation from a 'light ball' to a 'gun' is a key moment. Describe this transformation in more detail to make it feel more magical and powerful.</li>	You created an action-packed narrative that captures the feeling of an RPG game. 🏃‍♂️<br><br>To improve:<br><li><b>Show More Emotion!</b> 💖 You said you 'felt relief'. How did that relief manifest? A sigh? A smile?</li>	Your paragraphing is excellent, clearly separating each stage of your adventure, from realizing you're in the game to your escape. 🧱 This makes your story very easy to follow.<br><br>To improve:<br><li><b>Sentence Variety!</b> 🎼 While your paragraphs are well-structured, try to vary the length of your sentences even more. Short, sharp sentences for action moments and longer ones for reflection can enhance the rhythm.</li>	You used good gaming-related vocabulary like 'galaxy', 'action rpg', and 'transform'. 🎮<br><br>Here are a few corrections:<br><li><b>Infinitives!</b> 🛠️ 'Tried to communicated' -> 'tried to <b>communicate</b>'.</li><li><b>Adjectives!</b> 🅰️ 'A action rpg game' -> 'an action RPG game'. 'Thrill experience' -> '<b>thrilling</b> experience'.</li><li><b>Past Tense!</b> ⏳ 'I have played' -> 'I <b>was playing</b>'.</li><li><b>Subject-Verb Agreement!</b> ⚙️ 'The exit got blocked by an aliens' -> 'The exit got blocked by <b>aliens</b>'.</li>	5.0	3.0	4.0	3.0	Writing	Term 2 Midterm	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	B1+	\N	\N	\N	B1+	2026
