lural nouns. You should also try to reduce the repetition of words when you are thinking of what to say next to help your flow. You are a natural storyteller, so keep sharing your interests! 🌟	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/149T-QIza1cCqeNpsUNQzEvHxMwqCJN4X?usp=sharing	B1	\N	\N	\N	B1+	2026
