oping your ideas a little more will be excellent steps. Keep going; you're doing a fantastic job! <br><br>📋 **Action Plan:**<br>✔️ **Master subject-verb agreement:** Pay extra attention to ensuring your verbs match your subjects, especially with plural nouns and pronouns (e.g., "they have" not "they has").<br>✔️ **Practice final consonant sounds:** Consciously try to pronounce the ending sounds of words like /k/ in "think" or /l/ in "goal" to ensure every word is clear.<br>✔️ **Expand and elaborate:** Try to add a little more detail or explanation to your responses to make your ideas even richer and more convincing.	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1yqGR5ip5XtVuoI2jPIboJbuDxmsnlN7a?usp=drive_link	A2+	\N	\N	\N	B1+	2026
