2975	33170	2025-12-14 15:55:01.507149+00	Term 2 Midterms 2025-6	Me too! I've been waiting for months. I am so thrill I couldn't sleep!<br><br><br>The train sounds great! I usually have an issue sitting in a car for hours. It makes me want to throw up.<br><br><br>What about smore? It is easy to make and sweet. I don't really agree with the sausages idea though.<br><br><br>About that, I've planned to bring a bunch of blanket. Some warm jacket would be nice too but either of those keep us warm. And gloves too, I almost forgot! I think me should bring those to the camp to stay warm.	97	16.0	Hi Venice! 👋<br><br>I loved your expressiveness! "It makes me want to throw up" is a very vivid way to say you get carsick! 🤢 And "bunch of blanket" sounds very cozy. 🛌<br><br>Here are 3 tips for you: 📋<br>1. <b>Adjectives!</b> 🎨 "I am so thrill" -> "I am so <b>thrilled</b>".<br>2. <b>Grammar!</b> 🛠️ "me should bring" -> "<b>we</b> should bring" or "I should".<br>3. <b>Plurals!</b> 🔢 "bunch of blanket" -> "bunch of <b>blankets</b>".\n	You answered everything well. ✅<br><br>To improve:<br><li><b>S'mores!</b> 🍫 Great suggestion! It fits camping perfectly.</li>\n	Your tone is natural and engaging. 🌟<br><br>To improve:<br><li><b>Pronouns!</b> 👤 "I think me should bring" -> This sounds a bit like Cookie Monster! 😂 Use "I" or "we".</li>\n	Very clear paragraphs. 📝<br><br>To improve:<br><li><b>Linking!</b> 🔗 "About that" was a good linker for the warmth section.</li>\n	"Issue" and "thrill" are good words. 👏<br><br>Watch these errors:<br><li><b>Pronouns!</b> 👤 Object vs Subject. "Me go" ❌ -> "I go" ✅.</li><li><b>Word Forms!</b> ⚙️ "Thrill" (noun/verb) -> "Thrilled" (adjective).</li>\n	5.0	4.0	4.0	3.0	Writing	Term 2 Midterm	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	B1	\N	\N	\N	B1+	2026
998	28859	2025-08-12 14:00:00+00	Thai Food	Food is the truly important in the world. Although all the country have food, each country have own cultures. In particular, popular food varies from cultur to culture and from generation to generation. Three of the more successful styles are Mhu ping, chinken wing and lukchinping.<br><br><br>One important type of Thai street food is Mhu ping, a grill pork and sticky rice. Mhu ping ingredients are Grill pork, sticky rice, fish sauce, soy sauce, black sticky rice and pepper. An important thing how to make Mhu ping, you need to grilled the pork and boil rice and make it to besticky. The best taste of Mhu ping is salty and sweet because of the soy sauce. It smelled very good when you ate with sticky rice.<br><br><br>Beside Mhuping, Chinken wing is the best representative of street food. Chinken wings ingredients is just have Chinken wing and sticky rice. And How to make Chinken wing? You just need a chinkenwing and Fried with super hot oil. The chinken wing will very crunchy. The taste is salty because we mix with soy sauce too. It very tasty with sticky rice.<br><br><br>A final popular Thai street food is luk chin ping, a grilled meatballs. The symbolic of "Ping" mean grill and "Luk chin" means meatballs. The ingredients are meatballs and dipping sauce. This is how to make Lukchinping. It's the easiest dish. First you need to grilled meatballs on the pan and you bought dipping sauce and pour it on grilled meatballs. The taste of lukchinping is salty and a bit spicy because the sauce are spicy to make meatballs not to bland.<br><br><br>In short, Food had own culture and interesting. Thai Street food, Thai street food, a successful styles. Mhu ping is an excellent dish for me. Those taste change and make every dishes famous and very popular. However Food is a timeless favorite, loved and praised by many.	317	\N	Prize, your essay on Thai street food is well-organized with clear descriptions of each dish. You effectively introduced and concluded your essay. To improve, focus on your spelling and grammar, especially subject-verb agreement and article usage. Also, try to use a wider range of vocabulary to avoid repetition.	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	Writing	Formative	FIRST	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	2026
