ng to change the his work department to another department, he has to stop all of that and went back home to take care of his father. Three three months later his father pass away. So he decide to to to retire from his work at Japan and then he decide to work at Thailand to take care of his mom. Uh, at this part they were separate each other, it was the very long long distance relationship but luckily one day they his senior at at his workplace tell them that they were a new workers from Japan come here. At first Mueanfan feel very disappoint because they didn't see Ibuki's name at the list. But he surprise because he meet him! The point that Mueanfan didn't see his name because he change his his surname. And after that they become living happy together again at Thailand. Yeah! [clap] This is all about the story.<br>My favorite point is when Mueanfan introduced his boyfriend Ibuki to his family. This was the very cute and comfy scene that is very warm heartwarming and I really love this. And actually to be honest I don't have any part I don't like because this is the perfect story I have ever read. But I wish the author tell us about Ibuki and Mueanfan past more than they tell in the books. So that's all of the story. For the conclusion this is very the best book I ever read. I like the storytelling, the tone, the vibe, and the language that they use. If you all anyone enjoy BL's novel I would really recommend this book to you. Thank you. [clapping]	652	15.0	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	Speaking	CA	PET	Nam, thank you for sharing your book review with such energy and a great voice! Your enthusiasm for the story really came through in your speaking. While you have a score of 2 out of 5, you have some very strong foundations that we can build on together. 👏<br><br><b>What You Did Well:</b> ✨<br>Your speaking volume was excellent, and you were clearly audible throughout the entire talk. I was also very impressed by your intonation, which sounded dynamic and interesting to