he design,"" ""It is just an overpriced food that tastes mid""). While these errors generally do not impede communication, they are frequent enough to affect the overall clarity and precision of your language. To achieve a score of 5, you would need to demonstrate a higher degree of control and flexibility with grammatical forms, accuracy in spelling and punctuation, and a more precise and varied use of vocabulary, including less common lexis.	3.0	2.0	3.0	3.0	Writing	Term 1 Midterm	FIRST	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	B2+	\N	\N	\N	B1+	2026
