1024	28758	2025-08-14 08:35:01.039185+00	Thai Food	Food dishes are one the best part and intriguing the culture. Although, in every country, have their differnce food in each of their region, So these are 3 typicals region food dishes from Thailand are Nothern, Nothern East and Central, So There are "Kao-Soi", Soiju and Tomyam Kungo.<br><br><br>First, this dish is on of the people favorite is "Kao-soi". This dish is from the Nothern of Thailand. The main ingredients are noodles, chicken and those spices to make the soupy tasty like ginger, for how to made, it's actually made like noodles is boil, first boil those spices in to the hot water to make the soup, then boil the chicken, after that boil the noodles, and then, when you finished from boilling everything, pour them into the bowl and don't foget to top with the crispy noodles for the texture. So this dish is symbolizing the Thai culture by the traditional ingredients and the tasty taste.<br><br><br>Beside this dish is really individualistic so much, its come from the Nothern East of Thailand. This dish called "Soiju". This dish is really individualistic because of how to eat them, how they made and those ingredients. Those ingredients are raw beef, chillies, fish sauce, spices and some vegetable. This dish is so easy is simple to make, slice the raw beef, make the sauce mix those spices, chillies and fish sauce together and then get some vegetable to eat with, so you can enjoy it. So this dish is individualistic because we eat it raw, so it symbolizing how Thai people eat in the Nothern East and how its so unique.<br><br><br>Finally, the most famouse and had the best taste ever is "Tomyam Kung", from the Central of Thailand. People knows this dish that it's really delicious and easy to made, so the ingredients are shrimp, lime, chilli and spices, for how to make, it's made by boil, so boill those chilli and spices first to make the soup, then put the shrimp, you can put how many you want, and then, when you boiled everything finnish, pour into the bowl and enjoy. As you can see this dish is symboilzing the Thai culture the best by everythi in there was incredible,<br><br><br>In conclution, these dishes are symbolize the Thai traditional culture and how people cooked to lived in the past.	389	\N	Your essay on Thai food is a good effort with clear ideas and a developing range of vocabulary. You successfully describe three typical Thai dishes and their regional origins, which shows you understood the essay topic well. You also make an attempt to connect the dishes to Thai culture. To improve further, you should focus on increasing your grammatical accuracy, especially with verb forms and subject-verb agreement, and work on your spelling. Additionally, make sure your paragraphs have clear topic sentences and that you link your ideas smoothly between sentences and paragraphs.	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	Writing	Formative	FIRST	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	B1	\N	\N	\N	\N	2026
