llable should be unstressed.</p>	<p>Hi Pea! 👋 It's great to see your enthusiasm in presenting about Phraya Phichai Dap Hak. You clearly admire your hero and delivered your presentation with good energy. Keep practicing, and you'll continue to improve!</p>	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cFmq4K2oHYkE4yIkPRNskT3opJFRSJ--?usp=sharing	A2+	\N	\N	\N	B1	2026
