ng abruptly with And if you ask me ofcourse I'm in the not, you could conclude with a sentence summarizing your personal connection to the holiday.	Yayar, you use everyday vocabulary generally appropriately. However, there are noticeable errors in grammar and word choice that sometimes impede meaning. For example, I'm will be should be I will be, school in Thai are close should be schools in Thailand are closed, and Thai's civilian should be Thai civilians.	3.0	2.0	3.0	3.0	Writing	Formative	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	A2+	\N	\N	\N	A2+	2026
