e in how well your article is organised and how easily your readers can understand your message. 🗺️	You use everyday words effectively to describe Chinese New Year, Yaya, like "relative," "Angpao," "happiness," and the delicious foods you mentioned. You also show good control over simple sentence structures. However, there are a few areas where a little more attention to detail will greatly enhance your writing. For instance, check your verb agreement; you wrote "Chinese new year have" but it should be "Chinese new year *has*," and "This festival happen" should be "This festival *happens*." Another common area to watch is passive voice constructions, such as "it's call Angpao," which should be "it's *called* Angpao." These are common learning points for English students, and focusing on these will make your writing much more accurate. Keep up the good work on expanding your vocabulary. 🗣️	4.0	3.0	3.0	3.0	Writing	Term 1 Finals	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	B1	\N	\N	\N	B1	2026
