usin *has* to pick me," "It's could be safe" instead of "It *could* be safe," and "wacth the film" instead of "watch the film." Also, "it will be take so much time" should be "it will *take* so much time." The phrase "my pocket of crose" was also quite unclear, making it difficult to understand what you meant. Paying close attention to your spelling, verb forms, and sentence structure will really help your language accuracy.	1.0	2.0	2.0	3.0	Writing	Term 1 Finals	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	A2	\N	\N	\N	A2	2026
