cisely and demonstrate control and flexibility across a range of simple and complex grammatical forms with minimal errors. Please also try to use complex sentences ore frequently (You wrote: "My favorite food is Ramen. Because when I went there with my parents, it's a winter season.", when it would have been much better to say: "My favorite food is Ramen and I ate a lot of it when I went to Japan with my parents because it was winter and ramen is a cold weather food.	3.0	3.0	2.0	2.0	Writing	Term 1 Midterm	FIRST	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	B1+	\N	\N	\N	B1+	2026
