ddle part is confusing because the sentence is too long. Keep it simple.<br>2. <b>Suspense!</b> 😬 Describe the moment time stopped. Did the birds stop moving?	You used 'At first' and 'From that day' to mark time. 📑<br><br>To improve:<br>1. <b>Punctuation!</b> 🛑 Use more full stops. A sentence shouldn't be 5 lines long!<br>2. <b>Linking!</b> 🔗 Use 'However' or 'Therefore' to connect your short sentences.	You used good vocabulary like 'inventor' and 'equipment'. 👏<br><br>Here are a few corrections:<br>1. <b>Grammar!</b> 🛠️ 'He find the result' -> 'He *found* the result'.<br>2. <b>Prepositions!</b> 📍 'Searching about' -> 'searching *for*'.<br>3. <b>Word Forms!</b> 📝 'Equipments' is uncountable -> 'equipment'.<br>4. <b>Articles!</b> 🅰️ 'Check a machine' -> 'check *the* machine'.<br>5. <b>Verbs!</b> 🏃‍♂️ 'Sometime went wrong' -> 'Something went wrong'.	5.0	3.0	3.0	3.0	Writing	CA	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	A2+	\N	\N	\N	B1	2026
