e but all of them represent thailand by the flavour, the sauces, how it made. However these food show how thai food have grown and how thai food is now.	383	\N	Your essay demonstrates a good understanding of the topic and successfully introduces three popular Thai dishes. You use clear main ideas, and your vocabulary is generally appropriate. To improve, focus on sentence structure, particularly ensuring all sentences are complete and flow smoothly. Also, pay close attention to subject-verb agreement and proper capitalization.	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	Writing	Formative	FIRST	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	2026
