><b>Paragraphs!</b> 📝 Split the text: Paragraph 1 for 'Stores vs Online', Paragraph 2 for 'The Doll'.</li>	You used good vocabulary like 'coupons', 'verify', and 'comfortable'. 🎟️<br><br>Here are some corrections:<br><li><b>Grammar!</b> 🛠️ 'Be fitting with me' -> '<b>Fits</b> me'.</li><li><b>Comparatives!</b> 📏 'More cheaper' -> '<b>Cheaper</b>'.</li><li><b>Prepositions!</b> 📍 'Fine to your shopping' -> 'Fine <b>for</b> your shopping'.</li><li><b>Spelling!</b> 📝 'Confromtable' -> '<b>Comfortable</b>'.</li>	5.0	3.0	3.0	3.0	Writing	Term 2 Midterm	PET	\N	\N	a2e775c4-e795-45e6-b042-7e908b05f577	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	B1	\N	\N	\N	B1	2026
