rd count goal so you don't lose points for length!	You used some great vocabulary for a party, like 'ROV battle' and 'soft drinks'! To improve your grammar, keep an eye on 'subject-verb agreement' and small missing words. For example, you wrote 'The games... is', but since 'games' is plural, it should be 'The games... are'. Also, remember the 'is' in 'it is easy' and the 's' for possession: 'everyone's house'. You're doing great, keep practicing! 💪	4.0	3.0	2.0	3.0	Writing	Term 2 Finals	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	B1	2026
