tions. 📝	I loved your use of the word 'memorable'—that's a very high-level vocabulary choice! You have a good grasp of simple tenses. To improve, keep an eye on spelling and capitalization. For example, 'mrs Lake' should be capitalized as 'Mrs. Lake,' and 'eachother' should be two words: 'each other.' Also, remember that 'time' is usually uncountable here, so 'spending time' is better than 'spending times.' Keep practicing! 💪	5.0	3.0	3.0	3.0	Writing	Term 2 Finals	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	B1	2026
