2454	29031	2025-12-01 12:47:07.087453+00	Creative Writing	Sam finished his invention and pressed the button to start it. Suddenly a strange rushing sensation swooped through his mind. That's when he realized that his desired alter-ego had been unveiled. Before this Madness had escalated, just a moment before Sam had been outcast high-schooler who dreamed of becoming popular and so, he built the invention.<br><br><br>The following day came, and Sam had never ever been this excited for school in his whole entire life. He walked through the hallways with a big charismatic grin on his face. The others here puzzled by the sudden change of facade. Nevertheless, they joined along his shenanigans to the point where the whole school knows his name.<br><br><br>However, his preformance in class eruptly worsened. He couldn't answer any question nor understanding the topic. Despite his habit of studying aheand. The growing sharp pain distracted, Sam until he couldn't brought it up anymore. He had to get to the bottom of this.<br><br><br>Sam quickly rushed to his invention as it didn't take him long to understand the situation. His machine was slowly erasing his old-self and replacing it with the new Sam. He thought he could manage it but it would be far too late for him to build another. It was no either, staying his old "Airing" self or embrace his artificial skin. Sam was hesitant. Until a bright vivid memory of him doing the things he loved with the people who cared about him. Now, Sam realized his mistake and use this new confidence of his for its real use.<br><br><br>He felt the fake demeanor dissolving away as he regained himself again. But this time he wasn't disappointed. For the first time in years, he felt genuine and was at peace with himself.<br><br><br>Sam now understood that he didn't have to change all aspects of himself, that was dishonest himself. He knew that some people appreciate for no. matter. Who he may be.	316	20.0	Hello Racing, 👋<br><br>This is a truly thoughtful and sophisticated story! I was impressed by your confident use of advanced vocabulary like 'alter-ego', 'facade', and 'demeanor' to explore a complex theme of identity and self-acceptance. Your narrative is very engaging!<br><br>I have a few tips to help you polish your writing even further. 📋<br><li><b>Proofreading Precision!</b> 🧐 Even strong writers can catch small slips with a careful review.</li><li><b>Consistent Verb Forms!</b> 🔄 Pay close attention to verb agreement, especially with modal verbs.</li><li><b>Sentence Crafting!</b> ✍️ Refine your sentence structure to ensure every phrase is clear and complete.</li>	You crafted an excellent narrative arc, taking Sam from initial excitement to profound self-realization and acceptance! 🌟 The internal conflict of 'his machine was slowly erasing his old-self' was vividly portrayed.<br><br>To improve:<br><li><b>Show, Don't Just Tell!</b> 🧠 Instead of just stating Sam 'couldn't answer any question', show us! What did he do? Did he hesitate, or just stare blankly?</li><li><b>Resolution Clarity!</b> 🏁 The final sentence, 'He knew that some people appreciate for no. matter. Who he may be.', is powerful but could be rephrased for greater impact.</li>	Your writing style is highly engaging and mature, effectively capturing the reader's attention with its thoughtful exploration of Sam's journey! 🤩 The description of a 'rushing sensation' effectively sets the stage for the story's development.<br><br>To improve:<br><li><b>Pacing!</b> ⏱️ The transition from Sam's popularity to his failing in class could benefit from a smoother connection. Consider what might have happened *before* his grades dropped.</li><li><b>Voice Consistency!</b> 🗣️ While your voice is generally strong, ensure phrases like 'It was no either' are always clear and idiomatic.</li>	Your story is very well structured and coherent! 🏗️ The paragraph breaks you implemented effectively separate the different stages of Sam's internal and external journey. Your use of linking words like 'Nevertheless' and 'However' is highly effective. 🔗<br><br>To improve:<br><li><b>Internal Sentence Linking!</b> ➡️ Some sentences, like 'Despite his habit of studying aheand', could be more seamlessly integrated into the preceding sentence for better flow.</li><li><b>Clearer Transitions!</b> 🌊 Review transitions between ideas within paragraphs to ensure maximum fluidity. For example, 'It was no either' could be 'It was a choice between'.</li>	Your vocabulary is truly impressive, featuring words like 'charismatic', 'shenanigans', and 'demeanor'! You show a strong command of language. 👏<br><br>To improve:<br><li><b>Spelling Precision!</b> 📝 Proofread carefully for minor spelling errors such as 'preformance' (performance), 'aheand' (ahead), and 'eruptly' (abruptly).</li><li><b>Modal Verb Usage!</b> 🛠️ Remember that after modal verbs like 'couldn't', you should use the base form of the verb, so 'couldn't brought' should be 'couldn't <b>bring</b>'.</li><li><b>Gerunds vs. Infinitives!</b> 🔄 Phrases like 'nor understanding' often work better when matched with the preceding verb form, e.g., 'answer... nor <b>understand</b>'.</li><li><b>Sentence Completeness!</b> 🧩 Watch for fragments. 'That was dishonest himself' could be made clearer with 'which was dishonest to himself'.</li><li><b>Word Economy!</b> 🎨 Phrases like 'whole entire' can sometimes be simplified to just 'entire' for stronger impact.</li>	5.0	5.0	5.0	5.0	Writing	CA	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	B2	\N	\N	\N	B2	2026
