our use of linking words between paragraphs. However, the main area for improvement is accuracy in grammar and spelling, as well as developing your ideas further, especially regarding the cultural importance of the food. Keep practicing writing full sentences and reviewing basic grammar rules, and your writing will become much clearer and more effective.	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	Writing	Formative	FIRST	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	A2	\N	\N	\N	\N	2026
