llenge the idea that people are becoming less caring and highlight community spirit in Thailand. You provide relevant examples of emergencies to support your argument that people show empathy and help each other. All content is relevant, and the target reader is fully informed of your stance.	You effectively use the conventions of an essay to communicate straightforward ideas. Your opinion is well-expressed, and the essay generally holds the reader's attention. However, several grammatical inaccuracies and awkward phrasings occasionally hinder the clarity and fluency, making the communication less effective in conveying more complex ideas.	Your essay has a clear introduction, body, and conclusion, which provides a basic organisational structure. You use some linking phrases to connect ideas. However, the overall coherence is somewhat affected by abrupt transitions and a lack of varied cohesive devices. Improving the sentence structures and connectivity will enhance the flow	You use a range of everyday vocabulary related to community and caring. You attempt to use some more complex grammatical forms, but your control over them is limited. There are frequent grammatical errors that often impede communication, requiring the reader to re-read to grasp the intended meaning.	4.0	3.0	2.0	2.0	Writing	CA	FIRST	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	B1+	\N	\N	\N	B1+	2026
