ur use of two distinct paragraphs—one for your personal story and one for your general opinion—makes it very easy to follow.	You've used some lovely, expressive vocabulary like 'signature' and 'clumsy'. However, the score for language is a 3 because there are systemic errors throughout your sentences. For example, I noticed several 'comma splices' where two full sentences are joined only by a comma (e.g., 'serious person, they barely'). There are also awkward structures like 'one thing I find it's funny, my sister', and frequent tense shifts between present and past that make your stories slightly harder to follow.	5.0	5.0	5.0	3.0	Writing	Term 2 Finals	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	B1+	\N	\N	\N	B2	2026
