 grammar. For instance, there are a few moments where the subject and verb don't quite match, like 'The people... is' or 'people who makes.' Since 'people' is plural, remember to use 'The people... are' and 'people who make' instead.	5.0	5.0	3.0	3.0	Writing	Term 2 Finals	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	B1+	\N	\N	\N	B1+	2026
