se more full stops and capital letters to help separate your great ideas.	I really enjoyed the specific words you used for the food, like 'oreo or kit kat'—it made your writing very clear! I did notice a few small things missing, like the word 'a' in 'have party'. These are just small 'slips,' and your meaning is still very easy to understand. Keep using those great, specific naming words!	3.0	2.0	1.0	3.0	Writing	Term 2 Finals	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	A1+	\N	\N	\N	A2	2026
