iting, try to use more 'connecting' words like 'In addition to this' or 'Furthermore' to help your ideas flow like a real conversation. 📄	I really liked the specific words you used, like 'mario kart' and 'play station 5.' However, I noticed that you often used a small 'i' when you were talking about yourself (like 'i prefer') and had some spelling slips like 'Whe' and 'chesse.' Because these mistakes happen quite often, it can make your writing a bit harder to follow. Try to take a moment at the end to check your capital letters and spelling! 💪	5.0	5.0	3.0	3.0	Writing	Term 2 Finals	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	A2	\N	\N	\N	B1+	2026
