n gess to job that" is unclear.	You have connected your ideas using basic linking words, but the organisation could be improved. Try to separate your ideas into different paragraphs to make it easier to read. For instance, you could have a paragraph about what you like about the series, another about the story, and another about what could be improved.	You have used everyday vocabulary, but there are some errors. You have also used simple grammatical forms with some control, but the errors sometimes make it difficult to understand the meaning. For instance, "it can get feel better" should be "it can make me feel better," and "I'm the one person whose like to read" should be "I'm the one person who likes to read." To improve, focus on learning basic grammar rules and expanding your vocabulary.	3.0	3.0	2.0	2.0	Writing	Term 1 Midterm	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	A2+	\N	\N	\N	A2+	2026
