o follow! However, because the whole email is very short and doesn't use many words like 'and,' 'but,' or 'because' to join your sentences, it feels a little bit like a list of facts. Also, please note that your score was lowered here because the email was significantly under the required word count.	I noticed you used some great words like 'privacy' and 'console game.' These are excellent for this topic! I did notice you wrote 'it more privacy' and 'it more quietly.' This made the sentences feel a little bit incomplete, almost like a puzzle with a missing piece. In English, we usually need the word 'is' here, like 'it **is** more private.' Keep practicing these simple sentence structures!	3.0	2.0	2.0	3.0	Writing	Term 2 Finals	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	A2	\N	\N	\N	A2	2026
