t wishes.' This small change will make your email sound perfectly professional. ✨	I noticed that you used different groups for your ideas, like putting all the food talk in one place and the games in another. This is great because it makes your writing very easy to follow! 📄 You also used helpful connecting words like 'So', 'also', and 'just because' to link your thoughts together. For example, when you wrote 'so that's the reason I suggested those activities', it helped me understand exactly why you chose them. 🚀	You used some great new words like 'refreshing' and 'delicious' which really make your writing more interesting! 💪 I did notice a few small things to watch out for next time. For example, in the sentence 'pizza and mcdonald... there are my favourite', it would be better to say 'they are my favorites' because you're talking about more than one thing. Also, remember that we usually say 'I suggest playing' instead of 'I suggest to play.' 📈	5.0	4.0	5.0	4.0	Writing	Term 2 Finals	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	B1+	\N	\N	\N	B2	2026
