ar' instead of 'Last 2 years.' 💪 I also noticed you missed the word 'a' in 'Have a party.' Because these small mistakes happen in every paragraph, it can make your writing a bit harder to follow. For your next email, try to focus on adding that 's' to your words when you need it! 📈	5.0	4.0	3.0	2.0	Writing	Term 2 Finals	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	A2	\N	\N	\N	B1	2026
