de your ideas very clear and easy to follow! However, I saw that 'For activities or games.' was written as a very short, separate sentence. This felt a little bit like a 'stringy' start to a thought; next time, try connecting it to your suggestion to help the text flow even better.	You used some fantastic and specific words like 'challenging', 'quest', and 'bunch of space'. I noticed a small slip when you wrote 'I'd prefer have'; in English, we usually need to say 'I'd prefer to have'. Also, keep an eye on your spelling for 'reccommend', which has two 'm's. These are very small points, and your meaning was always very clear!	5.0	4.0	4.0	4.0	Writing	Term 2 Finals	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	B2	\N	\N	\N	B2	2026
