y mom bring me\\" (should be \\"my mom brought me\\"), \\"i don't know why but it's very nice to live here\\" (awkward phrasing), \\"who teach me\\" (should be \\"who taught me\\"), \\"i don't knew\\" (should be \\"I didn't know\\"), \\"Bangkok have a lot of thing\\" (should be \\"Bangkok has a lot of things\\"), \\"Huahinis the place\\" (missing space and awkward phrasing), and \\"I think you choose come and visit this city\\" (should be \\"I think you should come and visit this city\\"). Crucially, you used the word \\"Crap\\" (ขี้/ของเสีย) instead of \\"Crab\\" (ปู) when talking about seafood. Please remember that \\"crab\\" is spelled with a 'b' at the end.	3.0	2.0	2.0	1.0	Writing	Term 1 Midterm	FIRST	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	B1+	\N	\N	\N	B1	2026
