d message. To make your writing flow even better, try using more 'connecting' words between your ideas, like 'Regarding the ages...' or 'In my opinion...', to help your reader follow along more naturally. 🌟	In the sentence 'Because every body could have a chance for show they talent', your meaning is very clear, but the grammar is a little bumpy. Using 'they' instead of 'their' is like using the wrong key for a lock—it works eventually, but it takes the reader a second longer to understand your meaning. A great tip for next time is to double-check your possessive words like 'their', 'his', and 'her' before you finish your writing. 📚	5.0	4.0	3.0	3.0	Writing	Term 2 Finals	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	A2	\N	\N	\N	B1	2026
