d how you used clear paragraphs to separate each of your points! 📝 However, using 'First of all', 'Second', and 'Third' makes your email feel more like a numbered list of answers than a natural message to your teacher. To help your ideas flow even better next time, try using phrases like 'Regarding the ages...' or 'In my opinion...', which will make your email feel more like a real conversation. 🌟	Your choice of 'body shaming' shows you have a good range of modern vocabulary to express complex thoughts. However, sentences like 'it makes their students could be show abilitys' can be a bit like a bumpy road for the reader because there are too many verbs used together. Focus on using simpler verb structures, such as 'it allows students to show their abilities,' to make your writing feel more natural and clear.	5.0	3.0	3.0	3.0	Writing	Term 2 Finals	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	A2	\N	\N	\N	B1	2026
