 list of answers to Mrs Hallam's questions rather than a smooth, connected message. To help your writing flow even better, try using more 'internal' connectors within and between paragraphs, like 'However' or 'Because of this', to make the flow even more natural. 🌟	I see that you used some good vocabulary like 'pocket money' and 'out sources', but there are some recurring grammar hurdles like 'might only judged' and 'difference range'. These errors act like small speed bumps that make the reader slow down to understand your meaning, especially with verb forms and word types. A great tip for next time is to double-check that you use the base form of a verb after 'might' (judge) and use adjectives like 'different' to describe nouns. 📝	5.0	3.0	3.0	3.0	Writing	Term 2 Finals	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	A2+	\N	\N	\N	B1	2026
