ng the age group discussion from the prize suggestions. This structure acts like a map for the reader, making it very easy to follow your different thoughts without getting lost. 📝 However, each paragraph feels a little bit like an answer to a list of questions rather than a smooth, connected message. To make your writing flow even better, try using more 'internal' connectors between and within your paragraphs, like 'also' or 'additionally', to make the flow even more natural. 🌟	Your choice of words like 'abilities' and 'perform' shows you have a good range of vocabulary related to the talent show topic. While your meaning is always clear, small slips like 'everyone want' instead of 'wants' or 'It very usefull' missing the verb 'is' act like tiny speed bumps for the reader. A great next step would be to double-check that every sentence has a main verb and that it matches the subject correctly. 🧐	5.0	4.0	3.0	3.0	Writing	Term 2 Finals	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	B1	\N	\N	\N	B1	2026
