ction on prizes was very effective for structuring your thoughts. 📝 However, each paragraph feels a little bit like an answer to a list of questions rather than a smooth, connected message. To make your writing flow even better, try using more 'internal' connectors between and within your paragraphs, like 'also' or 'additionally', to make the flow even more natural. 🌟	When you wrote 'the talent show could just for students over 15', the sentence lacks a heartbeat because it is missing the verb 'be'. 🧐 There are also several other small grammar slips, such as using 'then' instead of 'than' and misspelling 'their' as 'thier'. These errors act like speed bumps that make the reader slow down to understand your meaning. A great tip for next time is to read through your work one last time to check that every sentence has a verb and that your spelling is correct. 📚	5.0	2.0	3.0	2.0	Writing	Term 2 Finals	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	A1+	\N	\N	\N	B1	2026
