r story moves forward in time clearly. ⏳<br><br>To improve:<br><li><b>Paragraphs!</b> 🧱 Break the text into 2-3 shorter paragraphs.</li><li><b>Linkers!</b> 🔗 Use words like 'Then', 'After that', or 'Suddenly' to connect your sentences better.</li>	You used some nice K-pop vocabulary like 'rapper' and 'albums'. 🎵<br><br>Here are some corrections:<br><li><b>Spelling!</b> 📝 'Belive' -> '<b>Believe</b>', 'Surprized' -> '<b>Surprised</b>', 'Beauiful' -> '<b>Beautiful</b>'.</li><li><b>Grammar!</b> 🛠️ 'I very liked them' -> 'I <b>really</b> liked them'.</li><li><b>Questions!</b> ❓ 'How they came?' -> 'How <b>did</b> they come?'.</li>	3.0	3.0	2.0	2.0	Writing	Term 2 Midterm	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	A2+	\N	\N	\N	A2+	2026
