th, connected message. To help your writing flow even better next time, try using more 'internal' connectors between and within your paragraphs, like 'Regarding' or 'Moving on to...', to make the flow even more natural. 🌟	I was very impressed by your use of expressive words like 'tempting' and 'splendid' and your ability to write complex sentences without errors. 🌟 You have a very high level of control over your grammar! Just keep an eye on small slips like 'I'm very agree' (instead of 'I definitely agree') and 'it suppose' (instead of 'it is supposed') to make your writing perfectly polished. ✨	5.0	4.0	3.0	4.0	Writing	Term 2 Finals	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	B1+	\N	\N	\N	B1+	2026
