ent Thai foods. You provide good details about each dish, which helps the reader understand them better. Your essay is generally well-organized, and your ideas are easy to follow. To improve your writing further, focus on grammatical accuracy, especially subject-verb agreement and article usage, and try to vary your vocabulary more to avoid repetition.	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	Writing	Formative	FIRST	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	2026
