nd makes your writing stand out. For your next article, try to use a slightly more personal tone by sharing if you would personally like to run with a dog robot—it would add even more charm to your great ideas! 🌟	I noticed that you divided your article into clear sections, moving from the current problem to your futuristic solution. 📝 This structure acts like a clear map for the reader to follow your logic. To make your writing flow even better, try to use a few more varied linking words like 'Furthermore' or 'Consequently' to connect your sentences more tightly together.	You used some fantastic modern vocabulary like 'technology year' and 'AI sports activities', which showed a great range of words for this topic! 💡 While your meaning was always 100% clear, there were some small slips with verb forms like 'young people are interest' (should be 'interested'). My best tip for next time is to check your actions to see if they need '-ing' or '-ed' to make your sentences sound even more natural and polished. 🌟	5.0	4.0	3.0	3.0	Writing	Term 2 Midterm	PET	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	A2+	\N	\N	\N	B1	2026
