uction, and you started your second body paragraph with "Besides..." as instructed. You also made an effort to include the symbolic and cultural value of the food in your body paragraphs, which is a key strength. To improve, focus on correcting common spelling and grammar mistakes, particularly run-on sentences and sentence fragments, and try to use a wider range of sentence structures, including passive voice.	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	Writing	Formative	FIRST	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	2026
