tly are Fisher man that why south food will have a crab, squid and a fish are main ingre tiant of south food	396	\N	Rico, your essay discusses three specific Thai dishes from the South of Thailand and makes an attempt to explain their cultural and symbolic value, which is a good start. You also correctly followed the instruction to use a simple thesis statement listing the foods, and you used the required transition phrase "Beside..." at the beginning of your second body paragraph. However, your essay needs significant improvement in grammar and spelling, as these issues frequently make it difficult to understand your intended meaning. You also need to work on incorporating relative clauses and passive structures to add variety to your writing, as these were not used.	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	Writing	Formative	FIRST	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	2026
