ow. The second and third paragraphs are very long and contain many different topics without clear connections. For example, you jump from talking about rafting to safety to a friend's resort and then to fish. To make your writing clearer, you need to break down your ideas into smaller, more focused paragraphs. For instance, you could have a paragraph just about rafting, then another about the food, and so on. Also, you used some linking words that did not quite fit, like \\"therefor\\" when it should be \\"therefore\\".	1.0	You used some everyday words, but there are many spelling and grammar mistakes that make your writing hard to understand. For example, you wrote \\"my favorit place is Kanchonaburi Why?\\" when it should be \\"My favorite place is Kanchanaburi. Why?\\". You also wrote \\"experint\\" instead of \\"experience\\" and \\"natweral\\" instead of \\"natural\\". There are many sentences where the words are in the wrong order, like \\"Kanchanaburi are one of the most natweral town in thailand\\" instead of \\"Kanchanaburi is a town in Thailand with some of the most beautiful nature in the country\\". These errors make it difficult for the reader to understand your message.	\N	\N	2025-07-23
