29034	2025-12-14 09:33:36.447643+00	2026	Term 2 Midterm M2A Part 2	I looked out the window and couldn't believe my eyes. My name is Sam, just a regular teen in highschool. I was so ordinary that I could be mistaken for an NPC! Untill one day I found a book in the library titled "Blood rains supreme".<br><br>I thought the cover looked suspicious. The grammar was wrong but I still opened the first page. All it said was "Blood from land fall to sky". After saying those words out loud I looked out the window.<br><br>I couldn't believe my eyes! The rainwater was red. I heard girls screaming. Students crying or shouting. Teachers were evacuating students indoors. Some students even called the cops. I was shocked. However it did feel nice that I did something in life.<br><br>It was three months afterwards when we learned the truth. Some protesters had put red dye in to the water reserves 2 days prior to the incident. That's why the water was red. Apparently the book was just a prank by one of the protesters.<br><br>Even if I didn't actually do anything memorable since it was just a prank. I still felt like I was some kind of wizard! Although I learned the lesson, find evidence before you assume something.	206	19.0	Hello Anu! 👋<br><br>This is a brilliant story! 🌟 I absolutely loved the 'NPC' voice you created for your character—it was funny and unique. The plot twist with the red rain and the prank book was clever and well-executed. You have a real talent for writing engaging narratives.<br><br>I have a few tiny tips to make it perfect! 📋<br>1. <b>Prepositions!</b> 📍 'Looked out the window' needs an 'of' -> 'looked out <b>of</b> the window'.<br>2. <b>Spelling!</b> 📝 'Untill' only has one 'l' -> '<b>Until</b>'.<br>3. <b>Word Choice!</b> 🗣️ For the book title, did you mean 'Blood <b>Reigns</b> Supreme'? (Reigns = rules). That would be a cool pun!	B2	Writing	Term 2 Midterm	PET	Part 1	4.0	Your story structure is excellent: Setup, Incident, Climax, Resolution, Reflection. ✅<br><