ve smoothly from one paragraph to the next! 💡	3.0	When you wrote 'My area are full of activities,' I noticed a small mix-up with subject-verb agreement. Since 'area' is just one place, using 'is' instead of 'are' helps the sentence flow more smoothly. ✨ A quick tip is to always check if your subject is just one or many before you pick your verb! ✨	\N	\N	2026-02-23
