y coherent, and you use sequencing words ("First," "Second," "Third") to guide the reader through your points. However, the lack of paragraphing weakens the overall structure. To improve, divide your essay into paragraphs, with each paragraph focusing on one of your key reasons for liking Bangkok. This will significantly improve the clarity and flow of your writing.	2.0	Ie Ie, the range of vocabulary and grammatical structures is adequate, but there are some noticeable errors. Examples include "where am I living right now," "Let say that Bangkok is quite of big," "impressed by this city are because," "There are breathtaking, too," and "garuntee." To improve, focus on using correct grammar and sentence structure. Pay close attention to word order, verb tenses, and article usage.	\N	\N	2025-07-11
