d other Thai herbs. First, heat water until it boils and add all of your herbs in it. Then, add some shrimps, limes and chillies. Finally, add whatever you want to make the taste better. This menu is full<br><br>In conclusion, all of these street foods that I have presented are full of Thai culture and traditions. Finally, foreigners who want to try some original Thai foods. of Thai foods and traditions. They'll attract many of Thai food.	416	\N	Hi Kris, this is a good essay about Thai street food! You've introduced some popular dishes and explained how to make them, which is very clear. It's great that you also tried to include some ideas about Thai culture in your writing. You have a good handle on writing, and with a bit more focus on accuracy and clearer connections, your writing will become even stronger!	\N	Writing	Formative	FIRST	Part 2	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-08-12
