u used words like 'ingredients' and 'hospital' correctly. 👏<br><br>Here are a few corrections:<br>1. <b>Verbs!</b> 🛠️ 'Hurted' -> 'hurt'. 'Fell terrible' -> 'felt terrible'.<br>2. <b>Spelling!</b> 📝 'Vegatable' -> 'vegetable'.<br>3. <b>Prepositions!</b> 📍 'Ingredients for cook' -> 'ingredients for *cooking*'.<br>4. <b>Articles!</b> 🅰️ 'The machine' is correct!<br>5. <b>Pronouns!</b> 👤 'He made it and gave her' -> 'gave *it to* her'.	\N	\N	2025-11-26
