aphic errors with capitalization (e.g., 'Which,' 'When,' 'So') and missing punctuation (e.g., commas after introductory clauses). While the meaning can generally be determined, these errors impede communication at times. To improve, focus on sentence construction and grammatical accuracy.	\N	\N	2025-07-11
