ar transitions between ideas. Using linking words like "For example," "However," or "Therefore" could help to create a smoother flow. Additionally, consider breaking your essay into paragraphs to separate different aspects of your experience.	2.5	You use everyday vocabulary, but there is some overuse of certain words and phrases, and some inappropriate word choices ("diffent," "stadard," "negates my preasure," "in not the ruls"). You use simple grammatical forms, but errors are noticeable and sometimes affect clarity. For example, the sentence "I think it like the peer preassure it make me feel like in not the ruls but it a thing that you have to match" contains several errors. To improve, focus on expanding your vocabulary and practicing sentence construction to reduce grammatical errors.	\N	\N	2025-07-13
