rs!</b> 🔗 You used 'And' and 'Then'. Try 'Suddenly', 'However', or 'moments later' to make it flow better.</li>	2.0	You tried to use some good descriptive words like 'mythic' (maybe you meant 'mysterious'?). 🤔<br><br>Here are some fixes:<br><li><b>Adjectives!</b> 🔄 'I was scary' -> 'I was <b>scared</b>'.</li><li><b>Verbs!</b> ⏳ 'Computer is shutdown' -> 'Computer <b>shut down</b>'.</li><li><b>Future in Past!</b> 🕰️ 'When I going to win' -> 'When I <b>was going</b> to win'.</li>	\N	\N	2025-12-14
