ople within communities.	4.0	You effectively use the conventions of an essay to communicate your ideas. Your introduction sets the stage well, posing a rhetorical question about neighbors. You successfully hold the target reader's attention by presenting a clear and consistent argument and effectively conveys your stance and persuades the reader. The tone is appropriate for an argumentative essay.	4.0	Your essay is well-organised and coherent, with a clear introduction, body, and conclusion. You use a variety of linking words and phrases, which effectively guide the reader through your arguments. The progression of ideas is logical, moving from a general statement about care to a specific focus on neighbors and then reinforcing your belief in the conclusion. Your paragraphing is effective in separating and developing your main points.	3.0	You use a good range of everyday vocabulary appropriate for the topic. You demonstrate a good degree of control over a range of simple and some complex grammatical forms. However, there are occasional errors that, while generally not impeding communication, are noticeable. Improving accuracy in spelling and ensuring consistent and correct capitalization will enhance the overall quality and polish of your writing significantly.	\N	\N	2025-07-13
