ld be better as "too busy with their work." These little adjustments in spelling and prepositions will make your writing even more polished. Remember to always proofread carefully for these kinds of errors – it makes a big difference! Sometimes in Thai, articles and plural forms are not as strict as in English, which can sometimes lead to these kinds of small mistakes. Keep practicing, and you'll master them! ✏️	\N	\N	2025-09-22
