ar.	2.0	You attempt to use the conventions of an essay and you express a straightforward idea. However, the clarity of your message is sometimes affected by imprecise language and awkward phrasing. These choices can make it challenging for the target reader to fully grasp your intended meaning and may hinder engagement.	2.0	You attempt to organize your text into paragraphs. However, the text lacks strong coherence. The phrasing "have pack in with other" is repeated and unclear, and transitions between ideas within and between paragraphs are not always smooth. Improving sentence structure and using a wider range of accurate cohesive devices would enhance the flow and logical progression of your essay.	1.0	You use some everyday vocabulary, but there are frequent instances of inappropriate word choice and significant grammatical errors. These errors are noticeable and often impede communication, making it difficult for the reader to understand your message. You need to focus on improving basic grammatical accuracy.	\N	\N	2025-07-13
