ose attention to spelling. Keep refining these areas to elevate your writing!	B1+	Writing	CA	FIRST	Part 2	4.0	Kaohom L, your essay is highly relevant to the task and effectively argues that people care deeply about their pets. You use strong personal examples to illustrate your point and clearly challenge the opposing view that pets don't need much attention. All content is relevant, and the target reader is fully informed of your perspective.	2.0	You use the conventions of an essay to communicate straightforward ideas, and your personal examples help engage the reader. However, the communication is significantly affected by numerous grammatical errors and awkward phrasing, which make it difficult to hold the target reader's attention consistently.	2.0	Your essay has a basic organisational structure. However, the coherence is compromised by very long and dense paragraphs which lack internal divisions and clearer transitions between ideas. This makes the text harder to follow and affects the overall flow.	2.0	You use everyday vocabulary related to pets and their care. While you attempt to use a range of grammatical forms, there are frequent and pervasive errors that often impede communication. The errors significantly affect the clarity and control of your language.	\N	\N	2025-07-13
