nventions of essay writing well to convey straightforward ideas. Your tone is appropriate, and you hold the target reader's attention by mixing descriptions of both facts and personal feelings. Some phrasing could be clearer, but your message comes across strongly.	3.0	Your essay has a generally clear organisation, with paragraphs handling different parts of the topic. However, some ideas could be linked more smoothly, and a clearer conclusion paragraph would strengthen the structure. Using more linking words would improve coherence.	2.0	You use everyday vocabulary related to the topic effectively. There are many errors in spelling (e.g., "usally," "gorgese," "anciant"). Grammar errors appear with verb forms and agreement. Your sentence structures are mostly simple but mostly clear. Improving spelling and grammar will help communication.	\N	\N	2025-07-11
