led everything finnish, pour into the bowl and enjoy. As you can see this dish is symboilzing the Thai culture the best by everythi in there was incredible,<br><br><br>In conclution, these dishes are symbolize the Thai traditional culture and how people cooked to lived in the past.	389	\N	Your essay on Thai food is a good effort with clear ideas and a developing range of vocabulary. You successfully describe three typical Thai dishes and their regional origins, which shows you understood the essay topic well. You also make an attempt to connect the dishes to Thai culture. To improve further, you should focus on increasing your grammatical accuracy, especially with verb forms and subject-verb agreement, and work on your spelling. Additionally, make sure your paragraphs have clear topic sentences and that you link your ideas smoothly between sentences and paragraphs.	\N	Writing	Formative	FIRST	Part 2	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-08-14
