ar!</li>	2.0	You have a basic timeline of events. ⏱️<br><br>To improve:<br><li><b>Linkers!</b> 🔗 Use words like 'Suddenly', 'Then', and 'After that' to help the reader follow the action.</li><li><b>Sentence Breaks!</b> 🛑 Some of your sentences run together. Use full stops to separate your ideas.</li>	2.0	You used some good descriptive words like 'deep dark forest'. 🌳<br><br>Here are a few fixes:<br><li><b>Grammar!</b> 🛠️ 'It's had way' -> '<b>There was</b> a way'.</li><li><b>Verbs!</b> ⏳ 'Something is came out' -> 'Something <b>came</b> out'.</li><li><b>Trust vs. Believe!</b> 🤝 'No one trust us' -> 'No one <b>believed</b> us'.</li>	\N	\N	2025-12-14
