aphs and a good selection of examples of Thai street food. You successfully discuss the cultural significance of each dish, as requested in the task. Your vocabulary, including words like "staple," "symbolic," and "adapt," shows a good range for a B1 level. To improve, focus on ensuring subject-verb agreement, especially with relative clauses, and practicing the correct formation of passive structures. You can also work on avoiding repetition of key nouns.	\N	Writing	Formative	FIRST	Part 2	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-08-14
