aginative and fun! 🤩<br><br>To improve:<br>1. <b>Pacing!</b> ⏱️ Slow down the transformation scene. Describe how it felt to change.<br>2. <b>Clarity!</b> 👓 'Bore a resemblance' is a great phrase, but make sure it fits the action.	4.0	You used amazing linking words like 'Subsequently' and 'Ultimately'! 👏<br><br>To improve:<br>1. <b>Sentence Variety!</b> 📝 Try to mix long and short sentences. Too many short ones can sound choppy.<br>2. <b>Repetition!</b> 🔄 You repeated 'Unknowingly he had created a disaster'. Remove one!	3.0	You used advanced vocabulary like 'uncontrollably' and 'furnished'. Great job! 🌟<br><br>Here are a few corrections:<br>1. <b>Verbs!</b> 🛠️ 'He in fact' -> 'He *was* in fact'.<br>2. <b>Nouns vs Verbs!</b> 🔄 'His live' -> 'His *life*'.<br>3. <b>Word Forms!</b> 📝 'Required you to touch' is good!<br>4. <b>Phrasing!</b> 🗣️ 'Does instant babies' -> 'creates instant babies'.<br>5. <b>Spelling!</b> ✅ Your spelling is generally very good!	\N	\N	2025-11-26
