ular Verbs!</b> 📝 'Shotted' -> '<b>Shot</b>'.<br>2. <b>Reflexive Pronouns!</b> 🪞 'Him self' -> '<b>Himself</b>'.<br>3. <b>Word Forms!</b> 🔄 'To eliminated zombie' -> 'To <b>eliminate</b> zombies'.<br>4. <b>Tense!</b> 🔙 'He didn't know it until... appeared' -> 'He didn't know it until... <b>appeared</b>'.<br>5. <b>Articles!</b> 🐜 'An game inventor' -> '<b>A</b> game inventor'.	\N	\N	2025-11-28
