35239	2025-08-16 15:33:55.190094+00	2026	Thai Food	Food is essential to everyone globally. Although it's a staple worldwide, it's also diverse internationally. Each dish has its own unique taste and look. One of the most popular food in the world is Thai food, more specifically food from the North, otherwise known as Isan food. Known for its vibrant flavours and diverse dishes. Some of the most well-known Isan dishes are Somtum, Larb and kai yang.<br><br><br>Somtum, made from shredded papaya mixed with chilli, garlic, lime juice and fish sauce, is one of the most well known Isan dishes. Made in a mortar and mashed all together with a pestle. Somtum is known for its fierey flavour. In addition, they're many types of Somtum like Tum Thai and Tum pla ra, for instance. Besides Somtum being impressively tasty, it's also incredibly impactful and authentical. It reflects the creativity of the people in Isan because it shows just they can mix such unique ingredients into something so heavenly.<br><br><br>Besides Somtum, Larb is also an exquisite Isan dish made from mixed meat, after you cook the meat you then mix it with lime juice, fish sauce and chilli flakes. It's known for its fierey and aromatic flavour. Often enjoyed with sticky rice and vegetables. It's also a cultural significance because the word 'Larb' means 'Luck' in Thai. Larb isn't just a flavourful dish, it's also a symbol of goodluck and represents Isan's creativity and complexity.<br><br><br>A final Isan dish is kai yang, a beloved Thai styled bird chicken, known for its salty and smoky flavour. It's made from chicken marinated with garlic, coriander root and fish sauce. It's then fried in hot oil. It's often enjoyed with sticky rice and Somtum. It's a very simplistic dish yet so flavourful. Its very popular, you can find it in every house and street stall. However It's more than a dish. It reflects Isans creativity to tweak a simple dish into something so delectable.<br><br><br>Isan food is more than a regional cuisine. It's a reflection of Thailand's community, creativity, nature and traditionalism. Dishes like Somtum, Larb and kai yang showcases how remarkable Isan food truly is. It's a representation of Thai culture. These dishes highlight the traditionalism and cultural heritage of Thailand.	301	\N	You have written a well-structured essay with clear ideas about Thai food. Your content is relevant and provides good information about the Isan dishes. You successfully incorporated comments on the cultural and symbolic value of the food, which was a specific requirement for this task. You also used some good B2 level vocabulary. To improve further, focus on correcting grammar mistakes, especially sentence fragments and subject-verb agreement.	\N	Writing	Formative	FIRST	Part 2	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-08-16
