riends' faces. Did they look blank? Scared?	3.0	You used 'At first', 'So', and 'Finally' correctly. 📑<br><br>To improve:<br>1. <b>Paragraphs!</b> 🧱 You could put the part about meeting his friends in its own paragraph.<br>2. <b>Connections!</b> 🔗 'And that was a beginning...' is a bit abrupt. Try 'This was the start of his problems.'	2.0	You used words like 'stranger' and 'exist' correctly. 👏<br><br>Here are a few corrections:<br>1. <b>Verbs!</b> 🛠️ 'Start to broken' -> 'started to *break*'. 'Learn to care' -> '*learned* to care'.<br>2. <b>Questions!</b> ❓ 'Why everyone can't remember me' -> 'Why *can't* everyone remember me?'.<br>3. <b>Spelling!</b> 📝 'Perfected' -> 'worked perfectly'.<br>4. <b>Pronouns!</b> 👤 'Sam he goes' -> 'Sam went'.<br>5. <b>Tenses!</b> ⏳ 'Everything got changed' -> 'Everything changed'.	\N	\N	2025-11-26
