aph Transitions!</b> 🧱 Ensure that the transition to the tragic ending is as smooth as possible, building on the previous emotions.	3.0	Your vocabulary is ambitious and used effectively! 👏<br><br>Here are a few corrections to help you:<br>1. <b>Spelling!</b> 📝 'Goverment' -> '<b>Government</b>'. 'Reallised' -> '<b>Realised</b>' (or 'realized' in American English).<br>2. <b>Verb Forms!</b> 🛠️ 'Creats' -> '<b>Creates</b>' (present tense) or '<b>created</b>' (past tense).<br>3. <b>Fragments!</b> 🗣️ 'No never mind.' -> '<b>I changed my mind.</b>' or 'Never mind.' (as a full sentence).<br>4. <b>Prepositions!</b> 📍 'Reached his hand to Daniels faces' -> 'Reached his hand to <b>Daniel's face</b>'.<br>5. <b>Word Choice!</b> 📖 'Bornis only friend' -> 'His only friend <b>since he was born</b>'.	\N	\N	2025-11-28
