ell and review them regularly. 📚<br><br>Many Thai learners find these areas challenging because English spelling is not always phonetic, and grammatical rules like subject-verb agreement and precise word choice are very different from Thai. Keep practising, and these improvements will make a big difference to your writing! 💪	\N	\N	2025-09-14
