ote 'it's give' instead of 'it gives' and 'Last 2 year' instead of 'Last 2 years.' 💪 I also noticed you missed the word 'a' in 'Have a party.' Because these small mistakes happen in every paragraph, it can make your writing a bit harder to follow. For your next email, try to focus on adding that 's' to your words when you need it! 📈	\N	\N	2026-02-19
