 new part for the food by writing 'Food?...'. This made it very easy for me to find the information I was looking for! You also used connecting words like 'because' to explain your thoughts. For your next writing, try to use a few more words like 'also' or 'and' to help your sentences stick together even more smoothly.	2.0	I noticed that you wrote words like 'idaen', 'brod', and 'dast'. Because there were many spelling mistakes like this, it felt a bit like I was reading a puzzle! I could still understand that you meant 'idea', 'board', and 'best', but it took me a little longer to finish reading. For your 'homework' next time, try to leave two minutes at the end to check your spelling of everyday words.	\N	\N	2026-02-19
