 of answers. 🧱 Also, some sentences like 'It would be give the gift' are a bit hard to understand. For your next writing, try to join your sentences together with words like 'because' or 'which' so your email flows like a real conversation. 📄	2.0	I noticed some small slips that happen many times in your email. For example, you wrote 'it good' instead of 'it is good' and 'open the music' instead of 'play music.' 💪 I also noticed you used 'their' instead of 'there' when you wrote 'fun their for the party'. Because these mistakes happen in every paragraph, it can make your writing a bit harder to follow. For your next writing, try to check that every sentence has a small word like 'is' or 'are' where it needs one! 📈	\N	\N	2026-02-19
