uestion about what you find funny. You've covered all the points with great detail and honesty.	5.0	You have a fantastic ability to hold the reader's attention with your bold and personal style! I really enjoyed the part about reading people 'like a book'. It makes you sound very insightful. You've used the conventions of an article perfectly to share a unique perspective that feels very real.	5.0	I noticed how beautifully your ideas flow from one paragraph to the next! You've used sophisticated connecting phrases like 'Not because... but because' and 'That's why'. This makes your article feel very professional and logical. It was a real joy to follow your train of thought through the entire piece.	4.0	I am so impressed by your vocabulary! I loved seeing great words like 'traumatic', 'unhinged', and 'cinematic'—they make your writing feel very grown-up! 🌟 I did notice that some of your 'action words' got a little bit mixed up, like when you wrote 'might said' or 'can't forgot'. Because you are using such exciting and complex ideas, it's easy for these small rules to slip. For your next piece, try to double-check that your words like 'might' and 'can' are followed by the simplest form of the verb (like 'say' and 'forget'). 🚀	\N	\N	2026-02-20
