g' and 'Second thing' to list your ideas. This is very clear! 🌟<br><br>To improve:<br><li><b>Transitions!</b> 📄 Try using 'Firstly' and 'Secondly' for a more formal style.</li>	3.0	Good job using words like 'comfortable' and 'greeting'. 🌟<br><br>Watch these errors:<br><li>'Teacher say to student' → 'The teacher <b>said</b> to the students'</li><li>'talk with her a lot' → 'talk <b>to</b> her a lot'</li>	\N	\N	2025-12-14
