ing more varied connecting words like 'Additionally' or 'On the other hand' to help your ideas flow more naturally. 🌟	3.0	When you wrote 'i'm not agree about it', I could still understand your meaning perfectly, but the grammar choice was a little 'bumpy'. 🧐 In English, we usually say 'I don't agree', so mastering this common phrase will make your writing much smoother. Your vocabulary choice like 'organise' and 'talent' is very appropriate! ✨	\N	\N	2026-02-23
