rent Thai foods. You provide good details about each dish, which helps the reader understand them better. Your essay is generally well-organized, and your ideas are easy to follow. To improve your writing further, focus on grammatical accuracy, especially subject-verb agreement and article usage, and try to vary your vocabulary more to avoid repetition.	\N	Writing	Formative	FIRST	Part 2	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-08-12
