28763	2025-08-12 13:00:00+00	2026	Thai Food	Food is the most important thing for everyone. If you don't eat food many days can have an affect on yours. We need food can help us happy when you eat it. Although every cultures in the world don't have same environment. So this make every cultures develops it own from their ingredients that have in their environment. In Thailand, Wherein have perfect environment for growing plants or hunting food. So this make Thai food interesting. But I think the northern Thai food are the most amazing, such as, Khao sai, Gaang hong lay and Gaang Ha<br><br><br>One of the best northern Thai food is Khao sai Which is a Thai curry noodle soup with Burmese and Chinese influences. It has egg noodles in a rich, flavorfal curry broth and is topped with crispy fried noodles. Ingredients of Khao sai are egg noodles, chicken drumsticks, coconut milk, red onion and fried egg noodles for crispy topping. To make Khao sai, first deep-fry some egg noodles until crispy and set them aside. Then cook the curry in oil until fragrant, add chicken and stir to coat. Next pour in coconut milk and chicken broth. Then season with fish sauce, sugar. Simmer until the chicken is tender and boil the noodles. Then put them in a bowl, pour the curry and the chicken on top and add crispy noodles.<br><br><br>A second interesting northern Thai food is Gaang hong lay, which is pork curry with Burmese roots. Ingredients of Gaang hong lay are pork, garlic and red chilli. To make Gaang hong lay, first fry garlic, shallots and ginger until fragrant. Then add spices. Add cinnamon, cloves and dried chilli. Then put in pork and stir until coated with spices. Add water and simmer until pork is tender. Season with fish sauce and sugar. Finally cook until the sauce thicken.<br><br><br>A third amazing northern Thai food is Gaang Ha. which is stir - fried mixed carry and made by combining leftovers curries, glass noodles and some vegetables such as, Kaffir lime leaves , galangal. T