', 'terrified', 'shattered', and 'realized'. 📚<br><br>Here are some fixes:<br><li><b>Verbs!</b> 🛠️ 'Try to figured out' -> 'try to <b>figure</b> out' or 'tried to <b>figure</b> out'.</li><li><b>Tense Consistency!</b> ⏳ 'Making sure that I have locked' -> 'making sure that I <b>had</b> locked'.</li><li><b>Punctuation in Dialogue!</b> 💬 For example, for 'My mom shouted "look what happend"', remember to put a comma before the speech: 'My mom shouted, "Look what happened!"'</li>	\N	\N	2025-12-14
