al context makes your article feel very authentic and interesting! 🚀	4.0	When you wrote 'trust me this is all for your body in the future,' you used a very effective technique to talk directly to your audience. 🚀 This friendly and persuasive tone keeps the reader interested in your message. To make your writing even more professional, try to avoid repeating the same location ('In Thailand') at the start of two paragraphs, as variety in your openings will help keep the reader's attention even more firmly on your great ideas! 🌟	4.0	I noticed that you used sophisticated linking words like 'Moreover', 'Finally', and 'Although' to connect your ideas. 📝 However, I also spotted a 'run-on' sentence where you used 'However' in the middle without a full stop before it (*'...badminton court However, sometimes...'*). My best tip for next time is to use a full stop or a semicolon before starting a new thought with 'However' to make your transitions perfectly clear for the reader! 📝	4.0	I see that you included sophisticated words like 'crucial' and 'massive,' which shows you have a fantastic vocabulary range! 💡 While your meaning was always 100% clear, there were a few bumpy spots with spelling (like 'exercies' and 'recieve') and subject-verb agreement. My best tip for next time is to do a quick 'final check' of your plurals and spelling to make your high-level writing shine even more brightly! 🌟	\N	\N	2026-02-23
