he conventions of essay writing to communicate straightforward ideas. The introduction clearly states your opinion, and the conclusion summarizes your main points. You maintain a consistent tone throughout the essay. To improve clarity, try to vary your sentence structure and use more precise language to express your ideas.	3.0	You present your ideas in a generally organized and coherent manner. You use linking words to connect your ideas. To improve, focus on using a wider range of cohesive devices to create a smoother flow between your paragraphs and ideas. Ensure that your paragraphs each focus on a single, clear point.	3.0	You use a range of everyday vocabulary appropriately and demonstrate a good degree of control over simple grammatical forms. There are some errors, but these do not impede communication. To improve, expand your vocabulary and pay attention to accurate use of grammar, particularly verb tenses and subject-verb agreement.	\N	\N	2025-07-13
